### Phase E matrix (minimum)

Offline before/during op; flap during sync; kill Electron mid-order / mid-print; Windows reboot; printer off/USB loss; API 500/timeout/lost response; double sync; double job submit → no business duplicate; UNKNOWN → no auto second slip.

## Do not

- Gate mutations on `navigator.onLine`
- Delete outbox rows before durable server ack of that `client_event_id`
- Rebuild print lines from current order for an existing job
- Auto-retry `UNKNOWN` print jobs
- Mix pharmacy `electron/offline` checkout schema with restaurant floor domain
- Start Phase F hub before A–E green on one terminal
